## 4. Tabulation (Space Optimization)

```python
class Solution:
    def zigzagSequence(self, mat):
        n = len(mat)

        prev = mat[0][:]

        for row in range(1, n):
            max1 = -1
            max2 = -1
            maxCol = -1

            for col in range(n):
                if prev[col] > max1:
                    max2 = max1
                    max1 = prev[col]
                    maxCol = col
                elif prev[col] > max2:
                    max2 = prev[col]

            curr = [0] * n

            for col in range(n):
                best = max2 if col == maxCol else max1
                curr[col] = mat[row][col] + best

            prev = curr

        return max(prev)
```

**TC:** O(n²)
**SC:** O(n)
